    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Warehouse Bots</i> is a resource management game where you build and automate high-tech warehouses using delivery robots. Plan layouts, design roads, control traffic, and manage a wide variety of goods as you fulfill orders under tight deadlines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through a story-driven campaign or dive into sandbox mode to build the ultimate logistics empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade modular warehouses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control fleets of autonomous delivery bots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design roads, traffic lights, and signage systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage maintenance, and equipment wear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill complex distribution orders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a relaxed sandbox mode with creative freedom</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design your warehouse layout from the ground up. Build walls, divide zones, and shape the flow of robots and cargo to suit your strategy.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/517bafa8fdb1153353b342ddc4f2f3ab.avif?t=1754557930\" width=1102 height=522 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PlacControl traffic with road signs and traffic lights. Prevent collisions, reduce delays, and keep your warehouse running smoothly.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/91861a793531677e8c92211a4df38c93.avif?t=1754557930\" width=1298 height=470 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage incoming orders with precision. Prioritize tasks, assign delivery bots, and keep goods moving to meet deadlines and maximize efficiency.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/7e3973198ddb3430d9741d049a44b359.avif?t=1754557930\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Warehouse Bots</i> is a resource management game where you build and automate high-tech warehouses using delivery robots. Plan layouts, design roads, control traffic, and manage a wide variety of goods as you fulfill orders under tight deadlines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through a story-driven campaign or dive into sandbox mode to build the ultimate logistics empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade modular warehouses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control fleets of autonomous delivery bots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design roads, traffic lights, and signage systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage maintenance, and equipment wear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill complex distribution orders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a relaxed sandbox mode with creative freedom</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design your warehouse layout from the ground up. Build walls, divide zones, and shape the flow of robots and cargo to suit your strategy.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/517bafa8fdb1153353b342ddc4f2f3ab.avif?t=1754557930\" width=1102 height=522 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PlacControl traffic with road signs and traffic lights. Prevent collisions, reduce delays, and keep your warehouse running smoothly.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/91861a793531677e8c92211a4df38c93.avif?t=1754557930\" width=1298 height=470 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage incoming orders with precision. Prioritize tasks, assign delivery bots, and keep goods moving to meet deadlines and maximize efficiency.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/7e3973198ddb3430d9741d049a44b359.avif?t=1754557930\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
